request.description:
List projects the current user interacts with for activity filters.

Available query examples:
- key={{project_lookup_key}} search by project name_en or name_kh
- limit={{limit}} pagination limit, default 20, max 100
- offset={{offset}} pagination offset, default 0

Response shape:
- id
- name{name_en,name_kh}
- logo{id,file_domain,url}
- pagination{total,limit,offset}

List members from projects the current user interacts with for activity responsible_by filters.

Available query examples:
- key={{user_filter_key}} search by member name_en or name_kh
- limit={{limit}} pagination limit, default 20, max 100
- offset={{offset}} pagination offset, default 0

Response shape:
- id
- name{name_en,name_kh}
- avatar{id,file_domain,uri}
- pagination{total,limit,offset}
